Package: Itemanalysis
Title: Tools for Item-Level Statistical Analysis in Psychometrics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Cesar", "Merino Soto", email = "sikayax@yahoo.com.ar", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Collection of tools for analyzing items in psychological and educational scales, 
    including nonparametric group comparisons, factorial simplicity indices, and item validity measures. 
    Implements both multigroup and pairwise approaches based on the Cucconi test for joint 
    location and scale differences, among other psychometric functions.
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
